   "line": 5,
   "text": "Each pair adds an arrow and its mirror arrow from lesson six, which leaves a plain number, sometimes negative. At forty-five hundred hertz, every pair pulls down, to minus point oh nine. Nine percent of that tone gets out, upside down, and lands at thirty-five hundred.",
